%% Phase5 / CHAIN / CHAIN-COM-G06 生命周期与已读
%% 机器真源: phase5.manifest.json；post_chain_close/retract/mark_read；chain_viewer
sequenceDiagram
  participant UI as MessageChainContentComponent
  participant F as ChainFacadeService
  participant T as Tauri bridge
  participant H as Helix Tick / chain
  participant G as Go post-chain lifecycle handlers
  participant PG as PostgreSQL chain/viewer_state
  participant DB as SQLite chain_summary/chain_viewer
  participant B as EventSink im:__bus__
  participant S as ChainProjectionStore
  UI->>F: close/retract/markRead(chainId,expectedRevision,lastReadSeq,clientMutationId,operationId,deviceId)
  F->>T: im_post_chain_close/retract/mark_read
  T->>H: Tick::Command(post_chain_*)
  H->>G: POST /api/cses/post-chain/close, /retract, /mark-read
  G->>PG: UPDATE chain or chain_viewer_state
  G-->>H: summary/viewer DTO
  H->>DB: PersistAtomic chain_summary/chain_viewer/chain_mutation
  DB-->>H: PortReply(PersistOk)
  H->>B: im:post_chain:close/retract/read_cursor
  B->>S: chainById / viewerById
  S-->>UI: chain-status / chain-read-state
